{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49068","headline":"秋日望倚帝山 · 吴筠","name":"秋日望倚帝山","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楚服多奇山，灵表先倚帝。\n孤秀白云里，青冥何崇丽。\n秋天已晴朗，晚日更澄霁。\n远峰列在目，杳与神襟契。\n倏忽遗世间，宛如再登诣。\n伊予抱斯志，代处人烟闭。\n何事牵俗网，悠然负芝桂。\n朅来从隐沦，式保羡门计。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49068.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49068","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}